// Copy to `.env` and fill in. Restart the dev server after editing.
//
// VITE_FORMSPREE_ID  Form endpoint id from https://formspree.io/f/<your-id>
//                    Leave blank and the contact form falls back to a mailto: link.
// VITE_GITHUB_TOKEN  Optional. Raises the GitHub API rate limit from 60/hr to
//                    5000/hr for the live stats fetch. A fine-grained token with
//                    no scopes is enough. Never commit a real token.
// VITE_CONTACT_EMAIL Public contact address (defaults to the one in src/data/profile.ts).
